      "info": "<html>\n<p>\nThis blocks computes the output <strong>y</strong>\nas <strong>sine</strong> of the input <strong>u</strong>:\n</p>\n<blockquote><pre>\ny = <strong>sin</strong>( u );\n</pre></blockquote>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\\\"modelica://Modelica/Resources/Images/Math/sin.png\\\"\n     alt=\\\"sin.png\\\">\n</p>\n\n</html>"
    }
